    "group": "Warpstrike Champions",
    "summary": "When your opponent's turn ends, you may pick some of your OBLITERATORS, MUTILATORS or HERETIC ASTARTES TERMINATOR units that are not within Engagement Range of any enemy unit. How many you may pick depends on battle size: up to 1 unit in Incursion, up to 2 in Strike Force and up to 3 in Onslaught. Lift the chosen units from the battlefield; they go into Strategic Reserves.",
